### Secret scanning ###
# gitleaks report output: scratch measurement output, never committed.
#
# A report can contain matched secret *values* in plaintext: the JSON report's `Secret`/`Match` fields are
# redacted only when --redact is passed, and some report formats are not covered even then. The redaction
# guarantee actually verified is recorded in
# .planning/quick/260816-hn1-wire-up-secret-scanning-gitleaks-truffle/260816-hn1-MEASUREMENTS.md.
.gitleaks-reports/

### Python (scripts/*.py gates and self-tests) ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc

### GSD internal state -- regenerated per session, not reviewable content ###
.gsd/
.planning/milestone.lock
.planning/state.json
.planning/research/.cache/
.planning/debug/*.tmp

### Playwright MCP browser-automation artifacts -- throwaway, never committed ###
.playwright-mcp/


